From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dp: describe the Uke primary DisplayPort controller

The OEM Cliffs controller starts at 0x0af54000, uses MDSS interrupt 12
and enables widebus. Its mainline resource description matches the
SM8650 descriptor; use an explicit SM7675 compatible, without claiming
SM8650 link rates, DSC, MST or physical Uke acceptance. The separate
QMP profile and native DPU catalog supply the remaining source pieces.
An admitted final Type-C graph and firmware route are still required.

Source: MiCode display DT 4a3e1c391130237c5e8c2b250d1c94f3e25b9b11
Files: display/cliffs-sde.dtsi, display/uke-sde-display.dtsi
License: GPL-2.0-only

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
index 22eade1..b714480 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
@@ -172,6 +172,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id msm_dp_dt_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sc8280xp-edp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sc8280xp },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sdm845-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sdm845 },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8350-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sc7180 },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm7675-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sm8650 },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8650-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sm8650 },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1e80100-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_x1e80100 },
 	{}
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/dp-controller.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/dp-controller.yaml
index 094a638..4d9e25e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/dp-controller.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/dp-controller.yaml
@@ -29,6 +29,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,sc8280xp-edp
           - qcom,sdm845-dp
           - qcom,sm8350-dp
+          - qcom,sm7675-dp
           - qcom,sm8650-dp
           - qcom,x1e80100-dp
 
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml
